        "Round 5": "Final transfer round: teams apply what they learned to a new version of the same challenge and attempt to beat their prior outcome.",
        "Guide Coaching Moves": "Notice the target behaviors: sets a strategy, monitors progress, uses feedback, changes approach, reflects on what worked. Ask: 'What evidence are you using?' 'What is your next move?' 'Who has not been heard yet?' 'What changed after that attempt?'",
